<Slide>
    <Box style={{
        width: '100%',
        height: '100%',
        background: '#FFFFFF',
        position: 'relative',
        padding: 0,
    }}>
        {/* A 区：页眉 */}
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            top: 0,
            left: 0,
            right: 0,
            height: 80,
            background: '#0E3F8C',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            alignItems: 'center',
            padding: '0 40px',
            gap: 14,
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                width: 6,
                height: 28,
                background: '#FFFFFF',
            }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                MobileForge · 无标注自适应
            </Text>
            <Box style={{
                background: '#FFC107',
                borderRadius: 4,
                padding: '3px 8px',
                marginTop: 4,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 600 }}>Preprint 2026 · 最新</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* C 区 */}
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            top: 80,
            left: 0,
            right: 0,
            height: 544,
            padding: '20px 40px',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            gap: 12,
        }}>
            {/* 上部 */}
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1.25,
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 18,
            }}>
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                    gap: 10,
                }}>
                    <Box style={{
                        background: '#F7F9FC',
                        borderRadius: 6,
                        padding: '12px 14px',
                        border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
                        borderLeft: '3px solid #D9534F',
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 4 }}>
                            研究动机
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                            目标 app 适配依赖人工任务/演示/奖励标注，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>成本高、易过时</span>；annotation-free 方法缺统一基底，rollout 奖励稀疏。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>

                    <Box style={{
                        background: '#F7F9FC',
                        borderRadius: 6,
                        padding: '12px 14px',
                        border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
                        flex: 1,
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                            MobileGym + HiFPO 闭环
                        </Text>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>MobileGym</span> · function-aware 探索（app anchor + 截图引导 DFS）→ Curriculum 把证据池 Z 转成可执行任务 x=(ι,B,c,v,p)
                            </Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>层级化 Critic</span> · 返回 F=(z, {'{ℓ}'}, h)：任务标签 z + 每步 reasonable 标签 ℓ + 纠错 hint h
                            </Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>HiFPO 三阶段</span> · ① Hint-guided 多次尝试 rollout ② 选最高 Q 的 attempt 且只保留 χ=1 步 ③ Hint-contextualized step-level GRPO（R=0.2·type + 0.8·param）
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1.1,
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                    gap: 8,
                }}>
                    <Box style={{
                        flex: 1,
                        background: '#F7F9FC',
                        borderRadius: 8,
                        border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
                        overflow: 'hidden',
                        padding: 10,
                        alignItems: 'center',
                        justifyContent: 'center',
                    }}>
                        <Image
                            src="assets/mobileforge-main-performance.png"
                            style={{
                                width: '100%',
                                height: '100%',
                                objectFit: 'contain',
                            }}
                        />
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{
                        background: '#E8EFF8',
                        borderRadius: 6,
                        padding: '8px 12px',
                        border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: 'center' }}>
                            探索 → 生成任务 → 自评估 rollout → hint 条件化 GRPO 完全闭环
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 下部 */}
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 10,
            }}>
                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: '#E8EFF8',
                    borderRadius: 6,
                    padding: '12px 14px',
                    border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                        主结果（900 生成任务）
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · ForgeOwl-8B AndroidWorld <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>67.2% P@1 / 77.6% P@3</span>
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · ForgeQwen3-8B 67.2% P@3，逼近 GUI-Owl-1.5-8B 基座 69.0%
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · MobileWorld GUI-only (OOD) <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>41.0% SR</span>，超所有 open-data 同类
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: '#F7F9FC',
                    borderRadius: 6,
                    padding: '12px 14px',
                    border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                        消融发现
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · Corrective hints：rollout 成功率 52.0%→<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>77.0%</span>，P@3 49.0%→72.5%
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · 反直觉：正确做法是「只删全成功的已掌握任务」（保留 [0, 0.9] 区间最强）
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            · 全 Qwen 开源 critic（无需 Gemini）也能 40.5%→<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>44.8%</span> P@1
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: '#0E3F8C',
                    borderRadius: 6,
                    padding: '12px 14px',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#B8CCE4', fontWeight: 600, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                        核心贡献 · 工程价值
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            首个完全 annotation-free 的目标 app 自适应闭环
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            HiFPO 把层级反馈分别用于任务过滤 / 步选择 / 训练条件化
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            已在快手 App 缺陷检测业务落地
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

                {/* 引用脚注 */}
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            top: 624,
            left: 0,
            right: 0,
            height: 36,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            alignItems: 'center',
            justifyContent: 'center',
            borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB',
            padding: '0 40px',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#4A5568', fontStyle: 'italic', fontFamily: "'Times New Roman', Georgia, serif", textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                Liu, G., et al. MobileForge: Annotation-Free Adaptation for Mobile GUI Agents with Hierarchical Feedback-Guided Policy Optimization. arXiv preprint, 2026.
            </Text>
        </Box>


        {/* D 区：页脚 */}
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            bottom: 0,
            left: 0,
            right: 0,
            height: 60,
            background: '#F7F9FC',
            borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
            alignItems: 'center',
            padding: '0 40px',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>
                浙江大学 · 控制科学与工程学院
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 600 }}>
                15 / 16
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
